        <body>
            <div xml:id="d670">

                <pb facs="0698" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg648"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Washburn to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1892-05-10"><hi rendition="#italic">May 10,
                                1892</hi></date>. (Received May 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 134.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to submit the reply of the
                    Federal Council to the request of the United States for the surrender to its
                    jurisdiction of Constance Madeleine His, under circumstances fully set forth in
                    your dispatches on the subject.</p>
                <p>It seems becoming in me to offer no suggestion at the present time upon the
                    subject, but to await the further instructions of the Department.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John D. Washburn.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d670-a1.xml" xpointer="d670-a1"/>
